 "notes": "T47D pHluorin2-GPI spheroid pilot. Nominal timepoint labels 24/48/72 h; actual read starts 10/19 15:53, 10/20 09:29, 10/21 09:28, i.e. 17.6 h then 24.0 h apart. 9 z-slices at 40 um, 10x, 1367 um / 1960 px, millicell96ULA u-bottom, no Cytation ZProj export, transmitted channel is 'Phase Contrast'. Fluorescence CameraGain 24 (exp1 22.9, MCF7 repeat 20, HEK293 10), LED 10, 5 ms, flat-field correction on, saturation 65504. L/M/H concentrations are the same dose sheet as the MCF7 screens (user-confirmed): omeprazole 10/100/1000 nM, bafilomycin A1 5/20/100 nM, rotenone 10/100/1000 nM, 3-BP 25/50/100 uM, phloretin 25/75/150 uM, oligomycin 30/100/300 nM, acetazolamide 10/100/200 uM. Row B is plated irregularly (user-confirmed): Oz M = B4,B5,B7 and Oz H = B6,B8,B9. A7/A8/A9 are single wells (dorsomorphin 2.5 uM, erastin 25 uM, TMZ 500 uM) and are descriptive only. shape_qc exclude is False in this config: the roundness flags are computed but not folded into qc_exclude, because T47D forms poorer spheroids and the gate is chosen after inspecting retention."
